@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

state "Off" as Off
state "Alarm Set" as AlarmSet
state "Ringing" as Ringing

[*] --> Off : initial state

Off --> AlarmSet : set alarm time / activate

AlarmSet --> Ringing : current time matches alarm time

Ringing --> AlarmSet : stop alarm / remain active for next scheduled time

AlarmSet --> [*] : turn off all alarms

@enduml
